<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<nc_page xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" version="1.2.1" xmlns="http://www.nintendo.co.jp/sdd/2010/page">
  <head>
    <create user="" host="" date="2026-11-03T07:20:21.2826383+00:00" source="" />
    <title />
    <comment />
    <generator name="NW4C ManualEditor Core" version="1.2.0.1" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <ncpg>
      <header>Installing Assets</header>
      <category>Setup</category>
      <paneSet>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="Legal">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="10" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="112" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="13.333333" y="16" />
            <text>For legal reasons, this homebrew port does not include the game's art or audio assets. You must own Among Us on Steam to play. This guide will show you how to download a clean version of the game files using the Steam Console, extract your legal copy's assets, and send them to your 3DS.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="Legal" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_09">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="132" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>Prerequisites</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_09" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_10">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="166" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="120" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>- Among Us owned on Steam.
- AssetStudio (scan the QR code below to install it).
- A method to transfer files to your 3DS (either ftpd homebrew app or taking out your MicroSD card).</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_10" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_11">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="550" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="48" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>Step 1: Download Game Files via Steam Console</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_11" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_12">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="608" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="320" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>Instead of using your installed game directory, you can pull a specific, clean version directly through Steam using its built-in console.

1. Make sure Steam is running on your PC.
2. Press `Win + R` on your keyboard to open the Windows Run dialog.
3. Type `steam://open/console` and press Enter. This will open the Console tab inside the Steam desktop app.
4. In the Steam console text box at the bottom, type the following command and press Enter:</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_12" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_14">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="938" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="36" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="15" y="18" />
            <text>download_depot 945360 945361 8969023746453332691</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_14" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_16">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="984" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="180" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>
5. Steam will begin downloading the depot in the background. Watch the console text for the completion message, which will output the exact file path where the files were saved (usually located under `Steam\steamapps\content\app_945360\depot_945361`).</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_16" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="Picture" name="Picture_00">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="32" y="292" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="256" y="256" />
          <picture>
            <vtxColLT r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <vtxColRT r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <vtxColLB r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <vtxColRB r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <textureFlip>None</textureFlip>
            <material name="Picture_00">
              <texMap imageName="assetstudio" imageNameLeft="" imageNameRight="" stereoEnabled="false" />
            </material>
          </picture>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_17">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="1174" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>Step 2: Extract the Assets</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_17" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_18">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="1208" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="220" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>1. Open AssetStudioGUI.exe.
2. Go to File &gt; Load Folder and navigate to the directory path provided by the Steam console in Step 1 (specifically targeting the folder containing `Among Us_Data`).
3. Wait a moment for the game files to load, then click the Asset List tab.
4. Click the Filter Type dropdown and check ONLY `Sprite` and `AudioClip`.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_18" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_19">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="1706" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="140" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>5. Press `Ctrl + A` to select everything in the list.
6. Right-click any highlighted item and select Export &gt; Selected assets.
7. Create a new empty folder on your Desktop called `assets` and extract the files there.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_19" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_20">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="1856" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="48" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>Step 3: Format the Folders &amp; Files</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_20" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_21">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="1914" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="280" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>The 3DS expects specific folder names and cannot read filenames with spaces.

1. Open your `assets` folder. You should see folders named `Sprite` and `AudioClip` (or similar depending on the AssetStudio version).
2. Click the address bar at the top of the File Explorer window, type `powershell`, and press Enter.
3. Copy and paste the following command into the blue window and press Enter:</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_21" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_22">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2204" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="126" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="15" y="18" />
            <text>Rename-Item -Path "Sprite*" -NewName "sprites" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Rename-Item -Path "AudioClip*" -NewName "audio" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue; Get-ChildItem -File -Recurse | Rename-Item -NewName { $_.Name -replace ' ', '_' }</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_22" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_23">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2340" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="100" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>4. Close PowerShell. Your folders should now be strictly named `sprites` and `audio`, and every file inside them will have underscores instead of spaces.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_23" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_24">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2450" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="24" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="20" y="24" />
            <text>Step 4: Transfer to your 3DS</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_24" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_25">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2484" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="40" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>You have two options to get `assets` onto your 3DS:</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_25" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_26">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2534" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="44" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="18.3333321" y="22" />
            <text>Option A: Using MicroSD Card (Fastest)</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_26" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_27">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2588" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="200" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>1. Power off your 3DS and take out your MicroSD card.
2. Plug it into your PC using a card reader.
3. Copy `assets` directly into the folder: `sdmc:/3ds/AmongUs3DS/`. (If the folders don't exist yet, create them).
4. Put the MicroSD card back into your 3DS and launch the game.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_27" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_28">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2798" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="22" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="18.3333321" y="22" />
            <text>Option B: Using `ftpd` (Wireless)</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_28" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_29">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="2830" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="308" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="18.3333321" y="22" />
            <text>1. Launch the ftpd homebrew application on your 3DS to start an FTP server and note your 3DS IP address.
2. Open an FTP client on your PC (like FileZilla).
3. Connect to your 3DS IP address using port `5000`.
4. Navigate to `/3ds/AmongUs3DS/` and upload your `assets` folder there.

Once the file is in place, restart the game on your 3DS!</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_29" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="Picture" name="Picture_01">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="1438" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="128" y="256" />
          <picture>
            <vtxColLT r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <vtxColRT r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <vtxColLB r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <vtxColRB r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <textureFlip>None</textureFlip>
            <material name="Picture_01">
              <texMap imageName="filters" imageNameLeft="" imageNameRight="" stereoEnabled="false" />
            </material>
          </picture>
        </pane>
      </paneSet>
      <paneHierarchy>
        <paneTree name="RootPane">
          <paneTree name="Legal" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_09" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_10" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_11" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_12" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_14" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_16" />
          <paneTree name="Picture_00" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_17" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_18" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_19" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_20" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_21" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_22" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_23" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_24" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_25" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_26" />
